      "stimulus": {"inline": "**SARS-style annual tax brackets (illustrative 2025/26)**\n\n| Bracket | Annual income (R) | Tax formula |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 0 – 237 100 | 18% of taxable income |\n| 2 | 237 101 – 370 500 | 42 678 + 26% × (income − 237 100) |\n| 3 | 370 501 – 512 800 | 77 362 + 31% × (income − 370 500) |\n| 4 | 512 801 – 673 000 | 121 475 + 36% × (income − 512 800) |"},
      "question": "An annual taxable income of R150 000 falls in which bracket?",
      "answerMode": "multiChoice",
      "options": ["1", "2", "3", "4"],
      "expectedAnswer": "1",
      "workingSteps": ["R150 000 < R237 100 → bracket 1."],
      "errorSignals": ["ERR_BRACKET_PICK"],
      "passThreshold": 0.85
    },
